// Type-checks the test files that `tsconfig.json` excludes.
//
// The package's own tsconfig excludes `**/*.test.ts`, so no test file was ever
// type-checked. That is not a cosmetic gap: a test can assert against a value
// whose type says the assertion is impossible, and a typed constant can hold a
// token outside its own union without anyone noticing.
//
// Every test file is checked here EXCEPT the ones listed below, which do not
// currently compile. The list is an opt-out that shrinks: deleting an entry and
// fixing that file is always an improvement, and adding one is a regression
// that should be argued for in review. It exists so the majority that already
// compiles is protected today rather than after a repo-wide cleanup.
